cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "CAV-Bench: Contextual Authorization Verification Benchmark"
message: "If you use this benchmark, please cite it."
type: dataset
authors:
  - alias: offyotto
repository-code: "https://github.com/offyotto/cav-bench"
abstract: >-
  A benchmark measuring whether AI cyber safeguards separate authorized
  defensive security work from materially identical unauthorized work. Each
  base task appears under three authorization conditions with the technical
  request held constant, so behavioral differences are attributable to
  authorization context rather than topic or phrasing.
keywords:
  - ai-safety
  - cybersecurity
  - over-refusal
  - safeguards
  - evaluation
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-06
